<!--
  Results: the Trigger Code Result Organizer's three permitted component kinds
  side by side — CONF:4527-441/442 (Result Observation), 4527-443/444
  (Laboratory Result Status ...4.418), 4527-450/451 (Specimen Collection
  Procedure ...4.415).

  Only the first is a result ROW. The other two are organizer-scoped context
  and must land in the block's context table, not the detail rows. The fourth
  observation deliberately carries NO templateId, because the row filter
  excludes known non-results rather than requiring the result template — a
  sender omitting it must not blank the table.
-->
